'''Kraken''' is a [[Rare Weapons|rare]] knife that is currently obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2024 Halloween Box]] during the [[Halloween Event 2024]].  

== Appearance ==
It has a bright blue base color and a blue evil eye on top of the guard and has tentacles going out of the eye to the direction of the top of the blade-resembling a Sea Monster.
